Entra ID credentials.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:18.180
He'll be asked for permission

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:22.620
to grant the agent to
act on his behalf.

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:24.420
It's called an OBO token.

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:28.980
Then at that point, the agent
can go grab an access token

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:30.330
using the OAuth 2 workflow,

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:33.540
